			## Plain Text Accounting? I Was Doing That Before It Was Cool... And With Actual Punch Cards 💾

			Oh, so the kids have discovered Plain Text Accounting and think it's REVOLUTIONARY?  Back in my day we called that 'keeping the books,' and we did it with a pencil, a ledger, and a whole lot of suffering.  Now you type a transaction into a .txt file and think you've reinvented the wheel?  Cute.  But I'll give you this—at least it's not another bloated JavaScript framework that can't add two numbers without a memory leak.  🧮
			"""
		}
